  <name>UseCashAndBankAccountsForLinesOfBusinessByCorrespondence</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use cash and bank accounts for lines of business by correspondence</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از حساب‌های نقد و بانکی برای خطوط کسب‌وکار بر اساس حساب مقابل</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Utilizzare la contabilità del flusso di cassa per le attività di corrispondenza</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Używaj ewidencji środków pieniężnych kierunków działalności według korespondencji</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать учет денежных средств направлений деятельности по корреспонденции</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Muhabire göre iş kolları kasa ve banka hesaplarını kullan</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng kế toán tiền mặt của ngành nghề kinh doanh thư tín</value>
  </synonym>
  <comment>Cash balances in the direction are determined by correspondence of receipts and expenses of this direction</comment>
